  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Heaven attached fungi grows only in the immemorial nine heavens and is a common feature across those heavens, like the astral wind flying heavenly boar. It is a rank six immortal material that must grow on its own without foreign dao marks; other life forms and even rocks cannot exist there. A field of it therefore marks a place Gu Immortals treat as safe to rest, and Yu Yi Ye Zi leaves Wind Sweeping Building to collect some as a rare opportunity. Bi Chen Tian later judges that one such field was bait after a huge star cloud storm closes on the resting party.",
      "chapters": [
        1244
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
