        "char_bi_chen_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In black heaven the fungi can appear as yellow-green growth like a giant carpet. The text restates it as a rank six immortal material unique to the immemorial nine heavens, requiring sterile ground with no other dao marks, life forms, or meteorites nearby. Ye Fan’s aurora bird killer move lands on a nearby patch and destroys the fungi there, leaving a tiny pit.",
